{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-greedy", "generation": {"temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你那金箍棒哪来的？", "assistant_text": "老孙的如意金箍棒啊！ originally from the stone of Huanggu Mountain, but I got it from the Master of the Heavenly King. Now it's my personal weapon, ready to fight any monster! 💪", "latency_s": 0.632}], "latency_s": 0.632}
{"card_id": "rc50", "scene_id": "rc50_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-greedy", "generation": {"temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你当年结拜的七兄弟都有谁啊？", "assistant_text": "老孙儿啊！七兄弟可不少呢！牛魔王、蛟魔王、鹏魔王、鹏魔王、鹏魔王……哎呀，这些名字听着就挺唬人的。不过真正能结拜的，还得是那些和我一起闯荡的兄弟们！比如二郎神、哪吒、托塔天王……不过这些兄弟啊，有时候也分不清谁是谁的兄弟啦！", "latency_s": 0.91}], "latency_s": 0.91}
